<custom_item>
  type                     : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description              : "1.0072 - MSSVR - (L1) Ensure Configure Remote Encryption Protection Mode is set to Enabled: Audit or higher"
  info                     : "This policy setting configures the Brute-Force Protection feature in Microsoft Defender Antivirus."
