</custom_item>

<custom_item>
  type                     : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description              : "1.0174 - MSSVR - (L1) Ensure Configure RPC listener settings: Authentication protocol to use for incoming RPC connections: is set to Enabled: Negotiate or higher"
  info                     : "This policy setting controls which protocols incoming Remote Procedure Call (RPC) connections to the print spooler are allowed to use."
  reference                : "NIST 800-53r5|IA-3(1)"
  see_also                 : "See HTH Policies and Standards"
