</custom_item>

<custom_item>
  type                     : AUDIT_POWERSHELL
  description              : "1.0248 - MSSVR - (L1) Ensure Modify an object label is set to No One"
  info                     : "This privilege determines which user accounts can modify the integrity label of objects, such as files, registry keys, or processes owned by other users."
  reference                : "NIST 800-53r5|AC-2 AC-5 AC-6 AC-6(1) AC-6(7) AU-9(4)"
